--- OUTPUT STRUCTURE ---
7:  - "research synthesis document"
22:## 1. OVERVIEW
24:### Purpose
26:Define the human-readable deep-research packet outputs: strategy, iteration markdown, synthesis, dashboard, resource map, and bounded spec anchoring.
28:### When to Use
32:### Core Principle
